{"text": "BROWN & WILLIAMBON TOBACCO CORPORATION\n\n1500 Brown & Williamson Tower\nLouisville Galleria \u00abP 0, Box 35090 \u00abLouisville, Kentucky 40232\n\nDecember 12, 1984\n\nDr. Derek Irwin\nBritish American Tobacco Company, Ltd.\nGroup Research & Development Centre\nRegent's Park Road\nSouthampton, $09 1PZ\nENGLAND\nDear Derek:\nPlease find attached a meeting report by Kelly St.Charles that\nSummarizes our current status with low aidestream cigarettes. We have\nreceived and are now evaluating all of the Papeteries DeMauduit (PDM)\nPepers. Most of our efforts during the past few weeks have been to\nfind the best blend and flavor for the ECUSTA TOD 2005 paper and the\nPDM papers.\n\nSincerely,\n\nNe eet\n\nRufus H, Honeycutt\nRAH/k1e/282\n166%\n\nAttachment\n\n620501739",
